# Ignore file for the source-mod gate only.
#
# Prettier defaults `--ignore-path` to `.gitignore`, and `.gitignore` hides `mods/*`
# so the builder repository does not swallow an unrelated checkout. Left alone that
# makes `prettier:mods` silently check nothing, so the mod scripts point at this file
# instead - the same opt-out `biome:mods` gets from `--vcs-use-ignore-file=false`.
#
# A source mod is checked in full, so only generated output and version control data
# belong here.

**/.git/
**/.ymb*/
**/dist/
**/out/
**/coverage/
